### 1) Seed demo events for multiple users
POST http://localhost:8097/api/demo/seed
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2) Analyze a specific user (targeted)
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior/analyze/user-1001

### 3) Analyze next user in queue (discovery)
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior/process-next

### 4) List all insights
GET http://localhost:8097/api/behavior/insights

### 5) Built-in analytics: rapidly declining users
GET http://localhost:8097/api/behavior/analytics/rapid-decline

### 6) Public demo dashboard
GET http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/dashboard

### 7) Seed and analyze all public demo scenarios
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/seed-and-analyze

### 8) Analyze one public demo scenario
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/scenarios/user-1001/analyze

### 9) Inject a new behavior signal and re-analyze
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/scenarios/user-1001/signals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "eventType": "CANCEL_INTENT",
  "eventData": {
    "message": "Customer says renewal failed twice and asks how to cancel before month end."
  },
  "source": "demo-ui"
}

### 10) Preview confirmation-gated retention offer
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/scenarios/user-1001/retention-offer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "discountPercent": 25,
  "confirmed": false
}

### 11) Confirm retention offer
POST http://localhost:8097/api/behavior-demo/scenarios/user-1001/retention-offer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "discountPercent": 25,
  "confirmed": true
}
